## Critical rules
- Never hardcode secrets; add vars to `src/lib/env.ts` + `.env.example`. Client vars need the
  framework's public prefix (NEXT_PUBLIC_ / VITE_ / PUBLIC_ / EXPO_PUBLIC_); everything else is server-only.
- Security headers live in `next.config.ts` (web) / the host `_headers` (static). Keep CSP strict.
- Log mistakes + fixes in `Docs/mistakes-and-fixes.md` as you go.

